      en: ["Chastel Blanc was originally built around 1102 AD.", "The city is located about 25 kilometers southeast of Tartus.", "The castle's tower has a height of 28 meters.", "Safita is famous for its high-quality silk and textile products.", "The city sits at an elevation of about 380 meters above sea level.", "The church within the castle tower has been in use for over 700 years."],
